    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "An update is available for haproxy.\nThis update affects Rocky Linux 8.\nA Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE list",
        "title": "Topic"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "The haproxy packages provide a reliable, high-performance network load balancer for TCP and HTTP-based applications.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* haproxy: HAProxy: Denial of Service via HPACK dynamic table insertions (CVE-2026-55204)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nThis advisory is provided by Ctrl IQ, Inc for Rocky Linux systems. For more information about CIQ security practices, visit https://ciq.com/security.",
        "title": "Description"
      },
